ST7701 display init sequence (src/display/Display.cpp)
------------------------------------------------------
The ST7701 480x480 init sequence is the one shipped by the Arduino_GFX
project (MIT license, https://github.com/moononournation/Arduino_GFX), as
transcribed in Tasmota discussion #20527. The same register values also
appear in the LVGL project's lv_lcd_st7701 driver (MIT license,
https://github.com/lvgl/lvgl).

